Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; This wil change how Windows Updates displays its messages, being explicit instead of vague
; Originally found on the webpage from The Register, with full URL as follows:
; https://www.theregister.com/software/2025/09/21/make-windows-11-less-annoying-with-these-registry-tweaks/502704

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SOFTWARE\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Policies\System]
"verbosestatus"=dword:00000001
